rint:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT の発言:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6aee572b-51e0-83ee-bc8d-eb0c6695892c" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="19fd3221-fe08-4f81-867f-49e87ca74966"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_br_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor; --darkreader-bg--markdown-link-color: currentColor; --darkreader-text--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="19fd3221-fe08-4f81-867f-49e87ca74966" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="19fd3221-fe08-4f81-867f-49e87ca74966"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">確認しました！これは<span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">11月6日（金）のポスター</span>ですね。</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">画像から読み取れる特徴は以下のとおりです。</p><ul class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">黒・金を基調としたデザイン</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">大きく「6日」「9時 OPEN」</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">筆文字風の数字・文字</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">下部に「抽選入場」「開店10分前」</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Playland HAPPY 手稲前田店</p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">11/2・11/3と同様に、既存レイアウトとの照合対象にします。</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">特に、今回も安易に新規レイアウトを作らず、既存の代表画像との比較を優先したいですね。11/6を独立したレイアウトとして登録するのは、既存のものと異なると確認できた場合だけにしましょう。</p></div></div></div><div class=