-darkreader-text--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="13bb18ec-56a9-4345-a00a-5ef11be349af" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="13bb18ec-56a9-4345-a00a-5ef11be349af"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">了解です！11月6日の登録画像に、このポスターも追加する扱いにします。既存の11/6の画像は残し、複数枚表示できる形ですね。</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">ただし、現時点ではGitHubへの画像ファイルのアップロードと登録完了まではできていません。登録済みと誤認させないよう、そこは区別しておきます。</p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="