hild]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor; --darkreader-bg--markdown-link-color: currentColor; --darkreader-text--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="87db013c-2766-49ae-b65a-5cd5a6e71d7c" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="87db013c-2766-49ae-b65a-5cd5a6e71d7c"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">登録先は確認できました。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">現在の11月6日には既存の </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">07.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);"> が登録されています。今回のポスターはそれを残して、2枚目として追加する必要があります。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">ただ、画像本体をGitHubに転送するところで接続上の制約に当たり、まだコミットできていません。</span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">登録完了とはしていません。</span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">追加先は </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">2026-11-06</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">、ファイル名は </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">08.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);"> とする予定です。既存画像やレイアウト履歴は変更しません。</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex m