b1c9e0-9104-45f5-b021-93ba3a4a9dae 7ab1c9e0-9104-45f5-b021-93ba3a4a9dae"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT の発言:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6aee572b-51e0-83ee-bc8d-eb0c6695892c" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="7ab1c9e0-9104-45f5-b021-93ba3a4a9dae"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_e0_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor; --darkreader-bg--markdown-link-color: currentColor; --darkreader-text--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="7ab1c9e0-9104-45f5-b021-93ba3a4a9dae" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="7ab1c9e0-9104-45f5-b021-93ba3a4a9dae"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">登録先は </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">site/images/2026-11-06/08.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);"> で確定しています。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">ただ、GitHubへの画像本体の転送がこちらの接続では実行できず、まだ登録を完了できていません。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">元画像は受け取れているので、再送は不要です。画像を劣化させずに登録できる方法で進めたいと思います。申し訳ありません。</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ri