rk" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="1c01b314-b4a4-4e30-8424-e3074491dfd2"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">おっ、GitHubへのサインインは確認できました！</span></p><div class="Badge-_iijmO Badge-G_joSy" data-color="success" data-size="sm" data-pill="" data-variant="soft" data-d-component="badge" data-d-weight="medium">GitHub認証成功</div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">アカウント </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">shakeourhands19-maker</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);"> で接続できています。リポジトリの参照も可能です。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">ただし、認証とは別に、今回の画像ファイルをGitHubへ転送する手段がまだ使えていません。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(224, 221, 217); --darkreader-text--d-stream-ink: var(--darkreader-text-e0ddd9, #d7d3ce);">登録先は引き続き以下で進めます。</span></p><ul class="List-rH8nmc"